# The tag of three members is one byte, loaded once. The switch names every member, so two comparisons tell the three apart: what is neither the first nor the second is the third, and no arm is left for falling off the end. The tag decides the layout: every field is a plain load with no shape test.
# CHECK-LABEL: name="evaluate" role=Source
# CHECK-NEXT: BB#0:
# CHECK-NEXT: Int64 b@[[node]] = ArgumentReg(
# CHECK-NEXT: Int32 b@[[op]] = Load8Z(b@[[node]], offset = 16, ControlDependent|Reads:ObjectFields{{*}}:GetSlot)
# CHECK: Int32 b@[[isSum]] = Equal(b@[[op]], $1(
# CHECK: Branch(b@[[isSum]], Terminal
# CHECK-NEXT: Successors: Then:#[[sum]], Else:#[[others]]
# CHECK-NEXT: BB#[[sum]]:
# CHECK-NEXT: Predecessors: #0
# CHECK-NEXT: Double b@[[left]] = Load(b@[[node]], offset = 24, ControlDependent|Reads:ObjectFields{{*}}:GetSlot)
# CHECK-NEXT: Double b@[[right]] = Load(b@[[node]], offset = 32, ControlDependent|Reads:ObjectFields{{*}}:GetSlot)
# CHECK: BB#[[others]]:
# CHECK-NEXT: Predecessors: #0
# CHECK: Int32 b@[[isTwice]] = Equal(b@[[op]], $2(
# CHECK-NEXT: Branch(b@[[isTwice]], Terminal
# CHECK-NEXT: Successors: Then:#[[twice]], Else:#[[literal]]
# CHECK-NEXT: BB#[[twice]]:
# CHECK-NEXT: Predecessors: #[[others]]
# CHECK-NEXT: Double b@{{*}} = Load(b@[[node]], offset = 24, ControlDependent|Reads:ObjectFields{{*}}:GetSlot)
# CHECK: BB#[[literal]]:
# CHECK-NEXT: Predecessors: #[[others]]
# CHECK-NEXT: Double b@{{*}} = Load(b@[[node]], offset = 24, ControlDependent|Reads:ObjectFields{{*}}:GetSlot)
# CHECK-LABEL: end of function
# NONE-LABEL: name="evaluate" role=Source
# NONE-NOT: AOTObject_shapeWord
# NONE-NOT: ExitsSideways
# NONE-NOT: Equal(b@{{*}}, $3(
# NONE-NOT: Switch(
# NONE-LABEL: end of function
# Some of the patchpoints are calls, and the moves around a call follow the calling convention, so the counts leave Windows out.
# X64-LABEL: name="evaluate" role=Source
